      "text": "Measuring/ Estimating a system",
      "fontSize": 27.39169211642928,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Measuring/ Estimating a system",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "vORWvmhp0bGLMHMC_OtQF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 409.303827505964,
      "y": 264.90241064582085,
      "width": 571.0396728515625,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 618309157,
      "version": 177,
      "versionNonce": 736209061,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794049010515,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> if you not measure a system then you faced 2 problems\n    (1) over spend\n    (2) under engineer",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> if you not measure a system then you faced 2 problems\n    (1) over spend\n    (2) under engineer",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "onJKSjAs69529atk3bd1e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 432.55095730915053,
      "y": 381.18382172829513,
      "width": 793.3195190429688,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 598385029,
      "version": 554,
      "versionNonce": 786178021,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794049588027,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(i) over spend:- if you make some small website and you can deployee\n    that website in multiple aws costly server then you over spend your\n    money\n\n(ii) under engineer:- you can run hoststar and you can deployee that in simple\n    server those are working normally but if virat kholi match are comming then\n    many people can open in your hoststar for watching and you can't handle your\n    server so that they can handle those users, and your server crached",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(i) over spend:- if you make some small website and you can deployee\n    that website in multiple aws costly server then you over spend your\n    money\n\n(ii) under engineer:- you can run hoststar and you can deployee that in simple\n    server those are working normally but if virat kholi match are comming then\n    many people can open in your hoststar for watching and you can't handle your\n    server so that they can handle those users, and your server crached",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "t7lkc8JsAiPtI-m9rHhgq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 405.92575495761264,
      "y": 690.0361690061343,
      "width": 771.199462890625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1941865829,
      "version": 83,
      "versionNonce": 1363222053,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794049640761,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> if you make any system then for mesure that system few criteria are there ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> if you make any system then for mesure that system few criteria are there ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oIAFyV7lffDMl5IDgN-l6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 398.645426189614,
      "y": 797.8931996570669,
      "width": 771.1395874023438,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1123672389,
      "version": 694,
      "versionNonce": 1401285381,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794050983419,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(1) Latency:- one user come they req somthing how much time user can wait for\n                getting a response called latency\n                \n                latency are less then 100ms --> very good\n                100 ms - 300 ms --> very good\n                1 sec --> {noticeable}\n                more then 1 sec --> not good\n\n(2) ThroughPut:-  Total request in one second {maximum request}\n\n\n                        50 crore user you have \n                        and every 1 sec :- 2 crore user live \n                        so, your throughput is 2 crore request\n\n(3) Bandwidth:- how much data can flow in one second\n\n\n                    it can mesure:- bits/sec",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(1) Latency:- one user come they req somthing how much time user can wait for\n                getting a response called latency\n                \n                latency are less then 100ms --> very good\n                100 ms - 300 ms --> very good\n                1 sec --> {noticeable}\n                more then 1 sec --> not good\n\n(2) ThroughPut:-  Total request in one second {maximum request}\n\n\n                        50 crore user you have \n                        and every 1 sec :- 2 crore user live \n                        so, your throughput is 2 crore request\n\n(3) Bandwidth:- how much data can flow in one second\n\n\n                    it can mesure:- bits/sec",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5lqhp7z4oGfmA3qyYJE2g",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 78.19745961696808,
      "y": 789.4271692914,
      "width": 147.7199249267578,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
