      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Read one thing from Ram --->  100 ns (nano sec)\nRead one thing from SSD --->  100 us (micro sec)\nRead one thing from HHD ---> 10 ms (mili sec)",
