      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "bandwidth:- \n                1 user send req/day:- 40\n                                                -> 90% text message:- 36 text (36 x 200 bytes)\n                                                -> 10% image message :- 4 photo (4 x 200 x 10^3 bytes)\n",
